# The Daily's setup and round left from the pause sheet ("Round Left" results), then an Expert practice
# round with a reshuffle, the board view's camera reset, Restart round and Leave round. (Generated alongside the others.)
until 300 Number Mahjong
frames 30
click Daily Challenge
until 60 Next daily in
frames 10
expect RANKED
save daily-setup
click =Start round
until 300 14 pairs left
until 300 Observe
frames 40
save daily-play
key Escape 1
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
click =Leave round
until 120 Round Left
frames 20
save daily-left
click =Back to title
until 60 Number Mahjong
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Unranked.
frames 10
click =Start Expert
until 60 Start round
frames 10
click =Start round
until 300 14 pairs left
until 300 Observe
frames 40
key KeyR 1
frames 40
key KeyC 1
frames 60
save practice-reshuffled
key KeyP 1
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
click =Restart round
until 300 14 pairs left
until 300 Observe
frames 40
key KeyP 1
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
click =Leave round
